// This is an example file for a bench craft using currency and the crafting bench.
// All rules from ExampleCurrencyCraft.craft apply.
// In order to use a crafting bench, make sure you have "Crafting Bench 2" in your hideout. Check the hideout editor.
// Always use the full name of a craft including its values, e.g. "(25-34) to maximum Mana".
// Bench crafts are indicated by the "Craft" prefix in the header.
// Do not manually select or de-select any bench crafts. If something fails, just open the bench again.
// The item in the bench when crafting starts is considered a potential crafting base.
// The example below spams Orb of Alteration when no prefix is open.
// It then crafts Mana on it when it does not already have a crafted mod.

#Global
Rarity == ItemRarity.Magic

# Craft (25-34) to maximum Mana
!ModsInfo.ExplicitMods.Any(DisplayName == "Upgraded") && ModsInfo.OpenPrefixCount >= 1

#$Orb of Alteration
ModsInfo.OpenPrefixCount < 1